        {
          "id": "p4-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "もう、ずっと雨でねえ",
          "en": "It just keeps raining, doesn't it."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "濡れた階段がこわくて、洗濯物も乾かないの",
          "en": "I'm scared of the wet stairs, and the laundry never dries."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この十日、誰とも口をきいてないのよ",
          "en": "For ten days I haven't talked to a soul."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……市で、何かできないの",
          "en": "...Can't the city do something?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "バケツ、一個八百円か。高えな",
          "en": "A bucket is 800 yen each? That's steep."
        }
      ]
    },
